n und dies zum Vorteil für alle nutzen. Allerdings kann sich längst nicht jeder mit den herrschenden Verhältnissen anfreunden. Einige schmieden insgeheim Pläne, die nicht nur Alpha, sondern die gesamte Galaxis ins Chaos stürzen könnten. Valerian und Laureline setzen daher alles daran, um das drohende Unheil abzuwenden.","poster":"/nHcYU10WEi2FyYgLdXZgrWSQd4h.jpg","runtime":138.0,"title":"Valerian - Die Stadt der tausend Planeten","type":"movie","va":6.7,"vc":8329,"year":"2017"},"movie:345909":{"cast":[{"id":1369329,"name":"Taylor John Smith","photo":"/6dXZRf8ePa1oxQN9a5hFGEjDoI0.jpg"},{"id":17832,"name":"Carla Gugino","photo":"/dAqGOsHSzlP6RhaUURX2NrwITaq.jpg"},{"id":1545693,"name":"Zazie Beetz","photo":"/sgxzT54GnvgeMnOZgpQQx9csAdd.jpg"},{"id":335,"name":"Michael Shannon","photo":"/6mMczfjM8CiS1WuBOgo5Xom1TcR.jpg"},{"id":4445,"name":"Chris Bauer","photo":"/1AjdNxbVmy6azlOxIfnCX5OruEA.jpg"},{"id":1427680,"name":"Jessica Rothe","photo":"/oItPXy56W0Y5taqIMZilRtnPDMn.jpg"},{"id":1474019,"name":"Jake Choi","photo":"/ftutoBlPWjWVjdT86wBZxLB13kU.jpg"},{"id":58619,"name":"Cindy Cheung","photo":"/j7zNyJHlAxqrsIUZYOObssZnj5s.jpg"}],"genres":["Drama"],"id":345909,"original":"Wolves","overview":"","poster":"/3a4YYmFf6BsKirzqPfmfPLHgS8r.jpg","runtime":109.0,"title":"Wolves","type":"movie","va":5.8,"vc":73,"year":"2016"},"movie:352978":{"cast":[{"id":64856,"name":"Michael Jai White","photo":"/YPoHYuzR37wFpPpwEXZYQlhLln.jpg"},{"id":21942,"name":"Max Ryan","photo":"/q21XcN0YzA7lDHuFbwGAV9O6N9J.jpg"},{"id":77120,"name":"Steve Austin","photo":"/xLc81J33tXrzlMjEFxBTKP4kgO0.jpg"},{"id":1714299,"name":"Ian Short","photo":""},{"id":87605,"name":"Allen Yates","photo":""},{"id":1344060,"name":"Ashley Barnett","photo":""},{"id":1630262,"name":"Carter Bratton","photo":""},{"id":2688331,"name":"Shyra Thomas","photo":""}],"genres":["Thriller","Abenteuer","Action","Krimi"],"id":352978,"original":"Chain of Command","overview":"Nachdem Elitesoldat James Webster und sein Team eine Verschwörung ranghoher Militärs aufgedeckt haben, wird ein Killerkommando auf sie angesetzt. Webster muss mit ansehen, wie seine Männer einer nach dem anderen getötet werden und bald steht er allein gegen die Feinde. Er kann niemandem mehr trauen und hat nichts mehr zu verlieren. Ihm bleibt nur noch die Flucht nach vorne: Es wird Zeit, den Spieß umzudrehen und Rache zu nehmen für seine gefallenen Kammeraden.","poster":"/xUHN0DIWS7fs3bMjg6RktQksK9v.jpg","runtime":88.0,"title":"Chain of Command","type":"movie","va":4.9,"vc":79,"year":"2015"},"movie:448820":{"cast":[{"id":220295,"name":"Geert Van Rampelberg","photo":"/jECzjJvrJdBrh6xf3aRpTOu3Qxi.jpg"},{"id":1647,"name":"Mikkel Gaup","photo":"/pStE5P1zBvElRWQdHK1cMCJ3H7m.jpg"},{"id":76384,"name":"Sara Sommerfeld","photo":"/mu19NyMyeRWYVubgiB4BAbszScK.jpg"},{"id":1402119,"name":"Daan Roofthooft","photo":""},{"id":1794463,"name":"Ayla Gáren Audhild P. Nutti","photo":""},{"id":1794464,"name":"Joakim Nils Tomas Trägårdh","photo":""}],"genres":["Abenteuer","Familie","Komödie"],"id":448820,"original":"Cloudboy","overview":"","poster":"/4a1xHMZ4XJ1OAaZ88kgT2ISvyc3.jpg","runtime":78.0,"title":"Cloudboy","type":"movie","va":7.4,"vc":8,"year":"2017"},"movie:462882":{"cast":[{"id":1712968,"name":"Kathryn Hanke","photo":"/vskh5Fmy5g8gOxLZzfuDCCZLo6l.jpg"},{"id":1837138,"name":"Sid Akbar Ali","photo":"/1FyWgAU4qbEuA132ctW9t7ohszV.jpg"},{"id":1837140,"name":"Kev McAuley","photo":""},{"id":1837142,"name":"Jamie Smelt","photo":"/2OJ9WBorSPTxNuHpD5uZjkQrvJg.jpg"}],"genres":["Komödie","Krimi","Horror"],"id":462882,"original":"Polterheist","overview":"","poster":"/yVg614khehKyNNnBd0mflrCjOAD.jpg","runtime":86.0,"title":"Polterheist","type":"movie","va":4.7,"vc":8,"year":"2018"},"movie:467979":{"cast":[{"id":582602,"name":"Alper Saldıran","photo":"/w6OoMfY4Bz4SSlbQICFmW0RMQE9.jpg"},{"id":1522700,"name":"Burcu Özberk","photo":"/wDhKUUR7pRzgVolACed0YnSozbL.jpg"},{"id":1159708,"name":"Burcu Altın","photo":"/eUunE6z280Sjde0J95Xb4eovrOf.jpg"},{"id":2464662,"n